{"id":160,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"分野別学習で個性を伸ばす咲くや中学校","feature_description":"大阪府立咲くやこの花中学校は、進取・創造・敬愛を校訓に、分野別学習と少人数指導で個性と才能を伸ばす学校です。週32時間の授業や体験学習、分野に直結した部活動を組み合わせ、将来の専門性につながる学びを意図的に設計しています。中高連携の特色も強く、学校全体で学びを深めます。 専門分野に直結した部活動まで見通せるため、学校の特色が比較しやすいです。","clubs":[{"id":2920,"name":"科学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www3.osaka-c.ed.jp/sakuyakonohana-js/5606babb80a5ce1a01651efdee7f3b12.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2921,"name":"数学研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www3.osaka-c.ed.jp/sakuyakonohana-js/5606babb80a5ce1a01651efdee7f3b12.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2922,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www3.osaka-c.ed.jp/sakuyakonohana-js/5606babb80a5ce1a01651efdee7f3b12.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2923,"name":"体操競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www3.osaka-c.ed.jp/sakuyakonohana-js/5606babb80a5ce1a01651efdee7f3b12.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2924,"name":"国語部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www3.osaka-c.ed.jp/sakuyakonohana-js/5606babb80a5ce1a01651efdee7f3b12.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2925,"name":"英語部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www3.osaka-c.ed.jp/sakuyakonohana-js/5606babb80a5ce1a01651efdee7f3b12.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2926,"name":"社会科部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www3.osaka-c.ed.jp/sakuyakonohana-js/5606babb80a5ce1a01651efdee7f3b12.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2927,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www3.osaka-c.ed.jp/sakuyakonohana-js/5606babb80a5ce1a01651efdee7f3b12.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-06"}],"profile_sources":[{"id":2644,"attribute_key":"feature_summary","source_url":"https://www3.osaka-c.ed.jp/sakuyakonohana-js/folder_1/post-34.html","source_kind":"official_site","external_school_code":null,"verified_at":"2026-08-06","source_excerpt":null,"fetched_at":null,"content_hash":null,"invalidated_at":null,"priority":null},{"id":2645,"attrib